WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.611 --> 00:00:11.035
Hello!

2
00:00:11.036 --> 00:00:15.173
Who are you?

3
00:00:15.173 --> 00:00:19.374
I'm a humpback whale.

4
00:00:19.374 --> 00:00:25.493
We are large sea mammals.

5
00:00:25.494 --> 00:00:27.910
Where do you live?

6
00:00:27.909 --> 00:00:32.475
Humpback whales live in the ocean.

7
00:00:32.475 --> 00:00:38.470
We travel very far every year.

8
00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:41.192
Where do you travel?

9
00:00:41.192 --> 00:00:46.763
We live in cold water in the summer.

10
00:00:46.763 --> 00:00:53.062
We swim to warm water for the winter.

11
00:00:53.062 --> 00:00:55.729
What do you eat?

12
00:00:55.729 --> 00:01:01.342
We eat small sea creatures and fish.

13
00:01:01.342 --> 00:01:19.660
Humpback whales are good hunters.

14
00:01:19.660 --> 00:01:24.719
I hear a song!

15
00:01:24.719 --> 00:01:29.712
Humpback whales make lots of sounds.

16
00:01:29.712 --> 00:01:34.797
Males even sing songs.

17
00:01:34.797 --> 00:01:44.412
Sometimes they sing for hours.

18
00:01:44.412 --> 00:01:47.799
Is that a hump on your back?

19
00:01:47.799 --> 00:01:53.773
No. That's my back fin.

20
00:01:53.773 --> 00:02:01.018
It's small and looks like a hump.

21
00:02:01.018 --> 00:02:04.175
You have a big tail!

22
00:02:04.175 --> 00:02:08.886
Our tails help us jump out of the water.

23
00:02:08.886 --> 00:02:15.271
Humpback whales love to splash.

24
00:02:15.271 --> 00:02:25.463
Watch this. Splash!

25
00:02:25.463 --> 00:02:28.759
Good-bye!

26
00:02:28.760 --> 00:02:34.400
Good-bye, Humpback Whale!

